WEBVTT

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:22.460
Vance! You traitor, prepare to be punished.

00:02:22.570 --> 00:02:27.470
You deceived us! What tyranny, making your own daughter the queen!

00:02:27.590 --> 00:02:29.320
Find Vance!

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:38.520
There're 200 coming from the west, 300 at the Castle gate, and more are coming.

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:41.480
I'll take care of them all.

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:43.240
Stand back and watch.

00:03:02.290 --> 00:03:06.490
I have never seen such weak soldiers rebel against the Vance family.

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:11.240
Well...

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:13.940
Why don't I take you on then?

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:16.480
Echidna...

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:20.020
How are you feeling, princess?

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:23.100
The view is excellent from there, right?

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:31.260
Hmph, it’s nothing great.

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:34.190
I'm overlooking your boring face after all.

00:03:38.430 --> 00:03:43.290
Well then, should I make your eyes bigger, so you can see even better?

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:46.250
I don't care. Do whatever you want.

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:49.240
What...

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.690
Sisters and yet so different.

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:59.140
Honestly, I thought you'd excite me more, but I was wrong.

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:01.530
Leina is so fortunate.

00:04:01.940 --> 00:04:05.930
She's always full of openings, and then at the last second, she pulls her opponent in.

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:11.730
Stabbing people... so thrilling, isn't it?

00:04:12.930 --> 00:04:14.620
You're the exact opposite.

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:18.620
Your guard is solid, but once it falls, you're a mess. {Alt liberal: For such a solid guard, you sure are a mess when it falls.}

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:20.920
You understand, don't you?

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:24.170
That constant feeling of insecurity about your petty limits...

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:35.470
That's why you both admire and hate Leina who has everything, right?

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:45.600
<i>Got you.</i>

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:53.180
A mercenary for 800 years... I see...

00:04:53.280 --> 00:04:58.180
you just threw everything away, even the things that mattered. Sound about right?

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:06.230
You thought you used me, but I'm the one who used you. You were too late to realize that.

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:15.550
Why not just go on living alone, you undying, old woman!

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:26.790
<i>Snake Tail!</i>

00:05:36.260 --> 00:05:38.040
Stupid little kid, aren't you?

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:40.840
Think of all those years I lived,

00:05:41.740 --> 00:05:44.580
like I'd be bothered by hearing those same words over and over.

00:05:47.060 --> 00:05:49.400
Damn, damn, damn it!

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:51.700
To think I would lose to the likes of you...

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:54.290
It's your fault for being weak.

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:56.020
Don't hate me for this.

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:59.200
You think I'm an idiot? This is part of my plan.

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:04.830
My father isn't here, and I could escape if I wanted to.

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:06.690
Then why don't you escape~ {You could put a ~ cause she speaks pretty childish here}

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:08.810
I'm waiting for my older sister.

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:11.950
You're waiting for Leina?

00:06:12.170 --> 00:06:13.130
That's right.

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:19.230
Whenever I'm in a life or death situation, my charming older sister appears to save me.

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:22.950
Elina! Elina, where are you?

00:06:24.010 --> 00:06:25.200
Onee-chan!

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:28.460
Ah! Everything is alright now, Elina.

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:31.560
Ah, onee-chan!

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:35.330
I was so scared.

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:38.480
Do you know how lonely I was from not being able to see you?

00:06:39.110 --> 00:06:41.620
I won't let you go. I'll always be with you.

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:43.160
Onee-chan!

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:46.320
My cute Elina.

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:55.070
And then, after that, she'll carry me like a princess and take me away! Of course on a white horse!

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:57.690
So don't you dare interfere, you snake woman.

00:07:03.530 --> 00:07:04.920
What's so funny?

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:10.700
You sisters never cease to amuse me.

00:07:11.350 --> 00:07:14.420
Well, until I get my payment, I'm free.

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:16.480
I'll hang out with you for now.

00:07:17.070 --> 00:07:20.790
What? I didn't really ask you to.

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:22.630
Will she really come?

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:24.460
She will! For sure!

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:25.970
I sure hope so.

00:07:27.350 --> 00:07:28.560
She'll definitely come!

00:07:42.990 --> 00:07:44.080
Mother...

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:09.880
Elina...

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:13.130
Onee-chan.

00:08:18.700 --> 00:08:20.300
It'll be alright, Elina.

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:23.010
I'm with you, right?

00:08:23.430 --> 00:08:26.470
I'll stay awake, so you won't be scared.

00:08:27.010 --> 00:08:27.480
Okay?

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:16.270
Onee-chan!

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:22.320
Ah, you've done it now.

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:23.170
Take this!

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:04.640
It's so pretty! It's like a gold coin.

00:10:05.390 --> 00:10:06.970
I-Is that so?

00:10:07.680 --> 00:10:10.320
It looks like an apple pie from here.

00:10:10.660 --> 00:10:12.520
Ah, that sounds delicious.

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:16.560
I really want some of mother's apple pie.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:20.710
Ah, I'm sorry Elina.

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:26.730
I'm the one who has to keep it together. I'm bad at cooking, but I'll give it a try tomorrow.

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:27.630
Okay.

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:38.530
You know what onee-chan? I wasn't lonely at all.

00:10:39.620 --> 00:10:42.130
That's because you were always with me.

00:10:52.890 --> 00:10:55.060
Hey now, what're you doing?

00:10:55.100 --> 00:10:57.190
You fell asleep, so I woke you up.

00:10:57.590 --> 00:11:00.790
The nobles said to not let you rest.

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:04.930
You better remember this; I'll send you all to hell.

00:11:04.980 --> 00:11:08.240
But Leina has to come save you first, right?

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:11.790
You're sure that you'll be able to see Leina again? {Must have listened to this a hundred times and I can't figure out the first part. Sounds like she says "You think she'd meet you with that torn shirt?" Next line would then be "I believe in her." yeah, fuck this line}

00:11:12.170 --> 00:11:14.420
I still believe she's coming.

00:11:17.180 --> 00:11:19.310
Regardless, this is still boring.

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:21.140
Oh, I know!

00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:26.450
Maybe I'll see how you taste.

00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:27.410
W-What...

00:11:34.680 --> 00:11:35.910
Or maybe not.

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:38.950
You really just don't turn me on.

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:42.130
The way you talk pisses me off.

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:51.430
Do you want a drink?

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:53.350
I don't need your charity.

00:11:53.720 --> 00:11:54.440
Is that so?

00:12:00.790 --> 00:12:04.280
I've got time, so I'll play with you for a bit.

00:12:17.230 --> 00:12:19.840
Oh, you don't like snakes?

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:22.240
I-I'm fine. This is nothing.

00:12:22.710 --> 00:12:24.550
That's a relief, isn't it Kere-tan?

00:12:25.420 --> 00:12:27.420
Looks like she's okay with it.

00:12:38.810 --> 00:12:41.000
Hey... slippery...

00:12:47.220 --> 00:12:51.030
You two really are sisters; your <i>sensitive</i> spot is the same.

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:53.550
You did the same thing to onee-chan!?

00:12:56.760 --> 00:12:58.060
Stop it already...

00:12:58.160 --> 00:13:02.250
Kere-tan, no biting. You know what happened to Leina last time.

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:05.210
I definitely won't let you get off to this!

00:13:05.950 --> 00:13:09.440
Oh, your tears are piling up, you know.

00:13:10.130 --> 00:13:15.570
You're not my type, but it's a lot of fun teasing you like this.

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:17.310
I'll definitely kill you!

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:21.400
You'll pay for the humiliation my sister and I suffered. {Alt: I'll make you suffer for humiliating my sister and me.}

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:24.850
I didn't really humiliate you two.

00:13:26.470 --> 00:13:29.860
By the way, what makes you believe in Leina?

00:13:30.260 --> 00:13:30.830
Huh?

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:34.140
You think just because you believe in her, she'll come save you? {Alt: You think just because you believe in her, she'll come save you?}

00:13:34.860 --> 00:13:36.970
I want to know the basis of that belief.

00:13:37.340 --> 00:13:38.910
Onee-chan is onee-chan.

00:13:39.400 --> 00:13:41.560
That's why she'll come and rescue me.

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:43.140
Based on blood ties?

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:44.700
You're so naive.

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:47.660
That's a ridiculous basis for a belief.

00:13:47.850 --> 00:13:48.890
Shut up, old hag.

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:53.540
Getting angry when it gets tough, you really are a kid.

00:13:54.630 --> 00:13:59.710
Leina is always so kind to me. That's why she'll definitely come here.

00:13:59.970 --> 00:14:02.250
Until then, I'll be fine no matter what you do to me.

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:04.970
Yeah, yeah, I understand.

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:10.710
However, are your thoughts getting through to Leina? {Alt: getting through to Leina}

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:18.770
I've thought that Leina's always been kind.

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:21.140
Always...

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:23.760
Onee-chan...

00:14:24.390 --> 00:14:25.170
Hey...

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:26.970
Don't just come in like that.

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:30.240
Knock before entering a room.

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:32.820
Until given permission, don't come in.

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:35.580
Ah, I'm sorry.

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:38.970
Hey onee-chan, do you want take a bath toge-.

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:41.580
I'm sorry, but can you take one by yourself?

00:14:42.290 --> 00:14:43.120
Why?

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:44.510
You asked why?

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:48.370
You keep touching me...

00:14:49.770 --> 00:14:55.700
Huh... it's fun for me to check up on you.

00:14:56.640 --> 00:14:59.150
Then I'll say this clearly.

00:14:59.890 --> 00:15:04.290
I think we're past the age of bathing together. {Alt: I think we're too old to bathe together now.}

00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:08.630
You got it? From now on, we'll take our baths separately.

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:13.350
I don't want that...

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:24.980
From that day on, Leina started spending more time alone and seemed to enjoy it.

00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:57.530
I am defeated. {Formal language so no contraction}

00:15:58.370 --> 00:16:01.920
Acting that slow in battle will kill you. {Alt: Acting that slow in battle will kill you, etc}

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:04.400
Onee-chan.

00:16:07.350 --> 00:16:11.400
I'll also be practicing my swordsmanship from today on.

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:12.420
I see...

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:14.360
Do your best.

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:22.570
Look, onee-chan. Here I go!

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:30.930
I am defeated.

00:16:30.950 --> 00:16:31.640
Wow.

00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:33.950
As expected from Elina-sama.

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:35.200
You scored very well.

00:16:35.570 --> 00:16:37.130
She's the reincarnation of Maria-sama.

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:41.440
Onee-chan, how did I do?

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:44.060
It was splendid.

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:46.170
Onee-chan...

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:50.260
Leina-sama only has the looks.

00:16:51.370 --> 00:16:52.310
It seems so.

00:16:52.810 --> 00:16:55.740
Even so, when compared to Elina-sama's excellence...

00:16:56.900 --> 00:17:03.580
Are you all prepared to face the consequences for insulting a soon-to-be count?

00:17:05.810 --> 00:17:06.820
Even though...

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:11.600
Sorry for intruding.

00:17:19.320 --> 00:17:21.060
I love her so much.

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:46.100
I hate corsets.

00:17:46.560 --> 00:17:48.440
What would it feel like if you tightened it further?

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:51.830
Then... will this much do? {formal language}

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:54.150
It's not tight at all.

00:17:54.830 --> 00:17:55.650
You're good at this.

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:57.520
I am honored.

00:17:57.950 --> 00:17:59.510
From now on, I'll leave this to you.

00:17:59.940 --> 00:18:00.920
Understood.

00:18:09.760 --> 00:18:10.360
Elina.

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:11.870
Are you changing?

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:14.960
I am, so can you please leave the room?

00:18:15.590 --> 00:18:21.250
I'll help you since it seems the maid went back to her country.

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:28.320
The only one who can be with her is me. {Alt: The only one who can be with her is me.}

00:18:35.280 --> 00:18:38.670
Onee-chan, why won't you come for me?

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:52.300
She isn't coming, is she? Your precious onee-chan.

00:18:52.870 --> 00:18:55.500
You know, you're really going to be executed.

00:18:56.290 --> 00:19:02.290
Well, I've already gotten paid, and I think it's about time I leave, but...

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:04.070
If you want to leave then just go.

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:08.890
My part is over, and you can escape now if you want.

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:10.150
She'll come.

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:12.760
Even now, you're still dreaming.

00:19:12.760 --> 00:19:14.860
She'll come, she'll definitely come.

00:19:16.700 --> 00:19:18.400
You're beyond salvation.

00:19:20.410 --> 00:19:27.180
These past few hundred years, I've seen far too many humans...

00:19:28.070 --> 00:19:33.650
...humans who are selfish or who are self-absorbed.

00:19:35.510 --> 00:19:39.140
Leina is a good person, but she's just the same.

00:19:40.370 --> 00:19:42.450
You had your expectations, but too bad.

00:19:42.960 --> 00:19:46.750
She won't abandon me when I'm in trouble.

00:19:47.340 --> 00:19:48.070
That might be true...

00:19:49.460 --> 00:19:50.270
but...

00:19:51.010 --> 00:19:52.270
if she returns here,

00:19:53.030 --> 00:19:57.970
she'll be dragged into the conflict between your family and the nobles, stopping her journey.

00:19:59.310 --> 00:20:04.120
If you think of it that way, even if she wanted to, she might not be able to come save you.

00:20:04.780 --> 00:20:05.660
That's not tru-

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:07.760
How many days has it been since the messenger left?

00:20:08.460 --> 00:20:11.660
Even on foot, Leina should've been here by now.

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:15.150
Time to make a decision.

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:19.020
Shut up, shut up, shut up!

00:20:20.050 --> 00:20:24.850
If she isn't coming, then living on is meaningless.

00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:43.970
Onee-chan...

00:20:52.030 --> 00:20:55.820
But which one is the real one?

00:21:02.970 --> 00:21:04.240
Get ready!

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:15.360
Onee-chan...

00:21:21.290 --> 00:21:22.100
She's here.

00:21:34.880 --> 00:21:37.060
Leina-onee-chan!

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:41.010
Elina!

00:21:51.530 --> 00:21:52.460
Onee-chan!

00:21:53.340 --> 00:21:55.380
<i>Dragon Tail!</i>

00:22:01.490 --> 00:22:01.840
Elina...

00:22:03.840 --> 00:22:04.650
Onee-chan...

00:22:06.250 --> 00:22:07.680
You really came.

00:22:12.150 --> 00:22:14.420
Your arrival was a bit late,

00:22:14.920 --> 00:22:17.980
but that was a rather good performance, onee-chan.

00:22:21.330 --> 00:22:22.720
I'm sorry for being late.

00:22:23.300 --> 00:22:25.400
The messenger mistook someone else as me.

00:22:27.300 --> 00:22:28.910
Ah, you look so worn out.

00:22:29.530 --> 00:22:30.540
Onee-chan...

00:22:31.490 --> 00:22:32.180
I'm sorry.

00:22:33.280 --> 00:22:37.570
Onee-chan, will you listen to my once in a lifetime request?

00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:38.360
Huh?

00:22:43.360 --> 00:22:45.360
It's been a while...

00:22:46.850 --> 00:22:48.710
Yeah... it has.

00:22:50.070 --> 00:22:54.320
Hey onee-chan, I have another request...

00:22:54.550 --> 00:22:57.270
Huh? Earlier you said once in a lifetime...

00:22:57.280 --> 00:23:00.830
I was scared, I was really scared.

00:23:00.890 --> 00:23:02.200
I got it...

00:23:03.030 --> 00:23:05.550
So what do you want me to do?

00:23:07.740 --> 00:23:10.400
I want to snuggle, onee-chan.

00:23:10.510 --> 00:23:11.320
What?

00:23:15.110 --> 00:23:16.870
I got it... geez...

00:23:21.490 --> 00:23:24.080
You won't be going anywhere anymore, right onee-chan?

00:23:24.970 --> 00:23:27.480
That's impossible. I won't hear any of that.

00:23:28.410 --> 00:23:29.170
Then...

00:23:31.170 --> 00:23:34.240
If that's the case, I have just one more request.

00:23:34.530 --> 00:23:38.280
Again? How many once in a lifetime wishes do you have?

00:23:45.550 --> 00:23:47.250
You're serious about this, Elina?

00:23:47.940 --> 00:23:48.710
Of course.

00:23:51.240 --> 00:23:55.980
These sisters never cease to amuse me, Kere-tan.

00:23:56.630 --> 00:24:01.380
If I win, you won't leave, and you'll be with me forever.

00:24:01.530 --> 00:24:02.010
What?

00:24:02.610 --> 00:24:03.210
What's this about?

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:04.450
Promise me.

00:24:06.600 --> 00:24:09.280
Then I won't hold back, here I come.

00:24:16.420 --> 00:24:17.500
She's strong...

00:24:45.100 --> 00:24:47.290
I lost, didn't I?

00:24:48.020 --> 00:24:50.590
Your strength hasn't fully recovered yet, sorry.

00:24:51.320 --> 00:24:54.010
But I understand how serious you were.

00:24:54.320 --> 00:24:56.040
No, I'm happy actually.

00:24:56.910 --> 00:25:01.100
You're strong as always; if it wasn't for your injuries, I might have lost.

00:25:04.720 --> 00:25:05.690
Liar.

00:25:14.880 --> 00:25:16.320
Onee-chan.

00:25:22.070 --> 00:25:23.410
Till we meet again.

00:25:23.770 --> 00:25:25.000
Till we meet again, onee-chan.

00:25:25.640 --> 00:25:26.510
Have a good journey.

00:25:27.870 --> 00:25:30.280
Is it ok to just let her go?

00:25:31.350 --> 00:25:34.080
It's fine. We made a promise after all.

00:25:35.910 --> 00:25:39.240
Humans are always like this.

00:25:40.830 --> 00:25:46.930
I'll definitely return someday and then with Claudette onee-sama, the three of us will live together.

00:25:47.860 --> 00:25:52.160
Until then, please help onee-sama in Gynos in my absence.

00:25:53.830 --> 00:25:54.630
I got it.

00:25:56.060 --> 00:25:59.850
This is something that she's entrusted me with, so I have to work hard.

00:26:00.840 --> 00:26:07.940
And when she returns, we'll have baths, massages, and do all sorts of things together.

00:26:11.170 --> 00:26:13.020
See you again.

00:26:23.920 --> 00:26:30.090
I'll eagerly await the day we can be together. {Alt: I'll wait eagerly until}

00:26:33.190 --> 00:26:40.910
Faith! Elina's
Unshakable Bond

00:27:14.320 --> 00:27:17.040
Everyone, clothes are here!

00:28:37.430 --> 00:28:42.250
So did you like that? I prefer more intense teasing though.

00:28:42.250 --> 00:28:44.960
Don't say that, snake woman.  I don't want to even remember.

00:28:45.330 --> 00:28:49.220
More importantly, she really came for me. I was so happy.

00:28:49.400 --> 00:28:51.360
Well then, I'll be going now.

00:28:51.780 --> 00:28:54.560
My kitties are waiting impatiently for me, see you.

00:28:54.590 --> 00:28:55.610
You'll make them cry instead!

00:28:56.000 --> 00:28:58.330
Well, I don't care if you're here or not.

00:28:58.660 --> 00:29:02.020
Next time, Longing! Alleyne's thousand year separation.

00:29:02.220 --> 00:29:03.560
Leina onee-chan!
